Football Training derives from Gameplay Football.

Source: https://github.com/vi3itor/GameplayFootball
Revision: 68159a2f0f96eec8ebba26ab7820130f36b922a7
Original game and Blunted2: Bastiaan Konings Schuiling, 2008-2015.
Modernized portions: Copyright 2019 Google LLC & Bastiaan Konings;
other contributors' notices are retained in their original files.
The imported fork is distributed under Apache-2.0; see LICENSE and
individual file notices. The Alegreya font has its own OFL license in data.

Modifications add solo training, robust SDL2 controller handling,
build/start instructions, diagnostics and validation.
Player models, field resources and animation files are retained from the
referenced fork. The additional DefenseJog_LoopF, Chest_Stand and Chest_Run FBX
animations were supplied by the repository owner. Their native-rig
conversions accompany the training packages; source provenance and hashes
are recorded beside the clips in data/media/training.
Ten non-contact locomotion cycles were retargeted from the Mocap.zip
FBX files supplied by the repository owner. Source names, hashes, take
ranges, native joint mapping and conversion details are recorded in
docs/mocap-retarget.json and docs/uploaded-motion-catalog.json.
The Unity C# source package is not redistributed with this project.
The training packages contain no proprietary PES executable or animation
bank. Optional local research tools are separate from the native training
gameplay; Gameplay Football fidelity is not a claim of PES equivalence.

