Motion matching and rotation-space inertialization reference the public
Motion-Matching implementation by Daniel Holden, copyright (c) 2021,
https://github.com/orangeduck/Motion-Matching (MIT license).
The full notice is in third_party/motion-matching/LICENSE.txt and is included
as MOTION-MATCHING-LICENSE.txt in the portable package. Its LAFAN demo motion
data and pretrained networks are not included or used for metric training.

pes-gani animation research tools by jhnzbdev and contributors (MIT).
https://github.com/jhnzbdev/pes-gani, commit 4f6dbf00f66df761ce2f6ac9b2d80af48e172788.
Reader code, name metadata and the complete license are preserved under
third_party/pes-gani. No PES gameplay equivalence is claimed.

media/training/pes17/short_pass.anim is a single retargeted test motion derived
from kick_short_0_0_inside_y0_000 in the PES 2017 dt13_win.cpk supplied by the
repository owner. PES assets remain the property of their respective owners;
they are not covered by this project's Apache-2.0 or the reader's MIT license.
Its adjacent JSON records provenance and the Football contact annotation.
Original CPK, MTAR, ASK and FRIG files and the decoded bulk library are not
included in the repository or portable release.
